</code></pre> <p>To retrieve the current value of a metadata entry, the code uses the <code>/metadata</code> <code>GET</code> endpoint with filters for <code>sourceAddress</code>, <code>targetAddress</code>, <code>scopedMetadataKey</code>, and <code>metadataType</code> (<code>0</code> for account metadata).</p> <p>The endpoint returns the list of entries matching the filters, which in this case contains a single item.</p>

